hadiths[161]{hadithnumber,text}:
"4159","amr by۔ abw slmh rzy allh anh khtay hyn kh myn rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm ky hfazt myn lrka tha، awr jb myra hath thal myn ghwmta tha tw aap sly allh alyh wslm nay mjh say kha: allh ka nam lay، apnay dahnay hath say khao، awr jw kchh hay as say khao۔ (bkhary w mslm)"
"4160","hzyfh rzy allh anh nay rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kw byan krtay hwyay kha kh shytan as kay lyay khana hlal smjhta hay jb as pr allh ka nam nhyn lya jata۔ mslm nay asay mntql kya۔"
"4161","jabr rzy allh anh say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya kh jb aadmy apnay ghr myn dakhl hwta hay awr khanay kay wqt allh ka nam lyta hay tw shytan khta hay kh tmharay pas rat gzarnay ky jgh nhyn hay awr sham ka khana nhyn hay، lykn jb wh allh ka nam lyay bghyr dakhl hwta hay tw shytan khta hay: tm nay rat gzarnay ky jgh pa ly، awr jb wh khta hay kh allh ka zkr krnay ky jgh nhyn mly، tw wh khta hay kh rat gzarnay ky jgh nhyn hay۔ sham ka khana۔\ * zmyr jma hay۔ kha jata hay kh shytan apnay maawnyn say mkhatb hay۔ mslm nay asay mntql kya۔"""
"4162","abn amr rzy allh anhma say mrwy hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”jb tm myn say kwyy khayay tw dayyn hath say khayay awr jb pyay tw dahnay hath say pyyay۔ mslm nay asay mntql kya۔"
"4163","as nay khda kay rswl kw yh khtay hwyay byan kya: \tm myn say kwyy bhy apnay bayyn hath say nh khayay awr nh pyay، kywnkh shytan apnay bayyn hath say khata awr pyta hay۔\"" mslm nay asay mntql kya۔"""
"4164","kab b۔ malk rzy allh anh khtay hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm tyn anglywn say khana khatay thay awr hath pr msh krnay say phlay chattay thay۔ mslm nay asay mntql kya۔"
"4165","jabr rzy allh anh khtay hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay lwgwn kw anglyan awr brtn chatnay ka hkm dya awr frmaya: tm nhyn jantay kh brkt ks hsay myn hay۔ mslm nay asay mntql kya۔"
"4166","abn abas rzy allh anhma say mrwy hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”jb tm myn say kwyy khayay tw apnay hath kw chatnay tk nh pwnchhay، ya ksy kw chatnay kay lyay nh day“۔ (bkhary w mslm)"
"4167","jabr rzy allh anh khtay hyn kh myn nay rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kw frmatay sna: ”shytan tm myn say ksy kay hr kam myn hazr hwta hay، htyٰ kh wh khanay kay wqt bhy hazr hwta hay، lhza jb tm myn say kwyy mnh ky kwyy chyz gra day tw asay chahyay kh as myn say kwyy tklyf dh chyz mta day awr asay khayay awr asay shytan kay lyay nh chhwray، awr jb fargh hw jayay tw apny anglyan chat lay، kywnkh wh nhyn janta kh khanay kay ks hsay myn brkt hay۔ mslm nay asay mntql kya۔"
"4168","abw jhyfh rzy allh anh say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”myn tyk lga kr nhyn khata۔ bkhary nay asay nql kya۔"
"4169","qtadh nay ans kay hwalay say kha hay kh nby sly allh alyh wslm nay kbhy km dstrkhwan ya chhwtay pyalay say nhyn khaya awr aap kay lyay ptly rwty nhyn pkayy gyy۔ qtadh say pwchha gya kh anhwn nay kya khaya tw jwab dya kh yh chmray kay kpray say hay۔ *as say apnay aap kw alg rkhnay، ya bkhl pr fkhr krnay ka asharh hwta۔ bkhary nay asay nql kya۔"
"4170","ans rzy allh anh khtay hyn kh mjhay as bat ka alm nhyn tha kh nby sly allh alyh wslm nay baryk rwty dykhy hw yhan tk kh aap allh taalyٰ say mlaqat kr gyay۔ awr nh hy as nay kbhy apny aankh say kwyy bhyr as ky khal myn bhny hwyy dykhy۔ bkhary nay asay nql kya۔"
"4171","shl by۔ sad nay kha kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay sfyd rwty nhyn dykhy jb say allh taalyٰ nay anhyn hkm dya tha jb tk kh allh taalyٰ nay anhyn nh lay lya۔ as nay yh bhy kha kh khda kay rswl nay as wqt say chhlny nhyn dykhy jb tk khda nay asay hkm dya jb tk kh khda asay nh lay۔ as say pwchha gya kh wh bghyr chhlkay jw kysay kha sktay hyn tw jwab dya kh anhwn nay asay pys kr phwnk mara awr jb as myn say kchh ar gya tw wh nm hw gyay awr jw bcha tha asay kha gyay۔ bkhary nay asay nql kya۔"
"4172","abwhryrh rzy allh anh khtay hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay kbhy khanay pr napsndydgy ka azhar nhyn kya۔ agr as nay chaha tw kha lya awr agr napsnd kya tw asay chhwr dya۔ (bkhary w mslm)"
"4173","as nay btaya kh ayk aadmy jw bht zyadh khata tha aslam qbwl kr lya awr km khanay lga۔ jb aap sly allh alyh wslm say as ka zkr hwa tw aap sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: mwmn ayk aant myn khata hay awr kafr sat aant myn۔ bkhary nay asay nql kya۔"
"4174","mslm nay abw mwsyٰ awr abn amr rzy allh anhma say srf why hsh nql kya hay js myn nby sly allh alyh wslm ka hwalh dya gya hay۔"
"4175","mslm nay abw mwsyٰ awr abn amr rzy allh anhma say srf why hsh nql kya hay js myn nby sly allh alyh wslm ka hwalh dya gya hay۔"
"4176","abwhryrh rzy allh anh ky ayk awr rwayt myn hay kh ayk aadmy jw kafr tha، allh kay rswl ky trf say mhman nwazy krtay thay۔ aap sly allh alyh wslm nay ayk bkry kw dwdh planay ka hkm dya awr as aadmy nay jw kchh as myn say nkala tha asay pya، phr ayk awr nay asay pya، phr dwsry awr as nay asay pya، yhan tk kh as nay sat bkrywn ka dwdh py lya۔ sbh hwtay hy as shkhs nay aslam qbwl kr lya awr rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay as kay lyay ayk bkry ka dwdh planay ka hkm dya۔ jb as nay as myn say jw kchh nkala tha py lya tw as nay dwsray kw dwdh planay ka hkm dya lykn jb sara dwdh khtm nh kya tw rswl allhﷺ nay frmaya: mwmn ayk aant myn pyta hay awr kafr sat aant myn pyta hay۔"
"4177","as nay khda kay rswl kw yh khtay hwyay byan kya kh \dw lwgwn ka khana tyn kay lyay kafy hay awr tyn aadmywn ka khana char kay lyay kafy hay۔\"" (bkhary w mslm)"""
"4178","jabr rzy allh anh nay rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kw yh frmatay hwyay sna kh ayk aadmy ka khana dw kay lyay kafy hay، dw ka khana char kay lyay kafy hay awr char aadmywn ka khana aath kay lyay kafy hay۔ mslm nay asay mntql kya۔"
"4179","aayshh rzy allh anha nay byan kya kh anhwn nay rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kw yh frmatay hwyay sna kh tlbynh batl kay dl kw skwn bkhshty hay awr as kay ghm kw dwr krty hay۔ * aatay ya chwkr awr dwdh say bna ayk qsm ka danh js myn kbhy kbhy shhd mlaya jata hay۔ (bkhary w mslm)"
"4180","ans rzy allh anh khtay hyn kh ayk drzy nay nby krym sly allh alyh wslm kw khanay pr blaya jw aap nay tyar kya tha awr myn bhy aap sly allh alyh wslm kay sath gya۔ as nay jw ky rwty awr swp pysh kya js myn kdw awr khshk kta hwa gwsht tha awr myn nay nby sly allh alyh wslm kw brtn kay grd kdw kay pychhay jatay hwyay dykha tw as dn say mjhay hmyshh kdw psnd hay۔ (bkhary w mslm)"
"4181","amrw by۔ amyh nay byan kya kh anhwn nay nby krym sly allh alyh wslm kw apnay hath myn gwsht kay kndhay say tkray kattay hwyay dykha۔ aap sly allh alyh wslm kw nmaz kay lyay blaya gya awr as chhry kw phynknay kay bad js say aap sly allh alyh wslm asay kat rhay thay، aap khray hwyay awr bghyr wzw kay nmaz ada ky۔ (bkhary w mslm)"
"4182","aayshh rzy allh anha nay kha kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kw mytha awr shhd psnd tha۔ bkhary nay asay nql kya۔"
"4183","jabr rzy allh anh nay byan kya kh jb nby sly allh alyh wslm nay apnay ghr walwn say msalhh jat tlb kyn awr anhyn btaya gya kh an kay pas srf srkh hay tw aap sly allh alyh wslm nay asay mngwaya awr jb aap asay apnay khanay myn astamal kr rhay thay tw aap sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”srkh ayk achha msalhh hay، srkh ayk achha msalhh hay۔ mslm nay asay mntql kya۔"
"4184","sayd by۔ zyd rzy allh anh say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”trafl ayk qsm ka mn hay awr an ka rs aankh kay lyay dwa hay۔ (bkhary w mslm۔) mslm ka ayk nskhh hay، ’’mn ky ayk qsm jw allh taalyٰ nay mwsyٰ pr nazl ky thy۔‘‘"
"4185","abdallh by۔ jafr nay byan kya kh myn nay rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kw kkry kay sath tazh khjwr khatay hwyay dykha۔ (bkhary w mslm)"
"4186","jabr rzy allh anh nay byan kya kh jb wh mrr alzhran myn rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kay sath thay awr arq kay drkht ka phl twr rhay thay tw aap sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”as kay kalay phlwn kay pas rhw، kywnkh yh sb say zyadh khwshgwar hyn۔ as say pwchha gya kh kya aap nay bhyryn chrayy hyn tw as nay jwab dya kh han، kya kwyy nby aysa bhy hwa hay js nay an kw chraya nh hw؟ (bkhary w mslm)"
"4187","ans rzy allh anh khtay hyn kh myn nay nby sly allh alyh wslm kw khjwryn khatay hwyay dykha۔ ayk wrzhn ka khna hay kh wh jldy say kchh kha rha tha۔ mslm nay asay mntql kya۔"
"4188","abn amr rzy allh anhma khtay hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay apnay sathywn say ajazt lynay say phlay dw khjwryn akthy krnay say mna frmaya۔ (bkhary w mslm)"
"4189","aayshh rzy allh anha say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: js ghr myn khjwr hw wh bhwka nhyn rhay ga۔ ayk nskhh myn btaya gya hay kh anhwn nay dw ya tyn bar kha، \wh khandan js myn khjwr nhyn hay، aayshh، bhwkay hwn gay۔\"" mslm nay asay mntql kya۔"""
"4190","sad rzy allh anh nay rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kw yh frmatay hwyay sna kh js nay sbh kw sat ajwh khjwryn khayyn asay as dn zhr ya jadw say nqsan nhyn phnchay ga۔ *mdynh mnwrh ky ayk achhy kwalty ka nam hay۔ (bkhary w mslm)"
"4191","aayshh rzy allh anha nay rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm say rwayt ky kh: \alaalyh* ky ajwh khjwr myn shfaa hay، awr yh sbh ky phly chyz ka tryaq hyn۔\"" *mdynh say chnd myl mshrq myn kchh dyhatwn pr ayk nam ka atlaq hwta hay۔ mslm nay asay mntql kya۔"""
"4192","as nay kha kh kbhy kbhy kwyy mhynh aysa aata tha js myn wh aag nhyn jlatay thay، srf khjwr awr pany hwta tha، swayay as kay kh thwra sa gwsht laya jayay۔ (bkhary w mslm)"
"4193","as nay kha kh mhmd kay khandan nay lgatar dw dn gndm ky rwty ka pwra khana nhyn khaya، lykn an myn say ayk pr khjwr hwgy۔ (bkhary w mslm)"
"4194","**Aisha (Radi Allahu Anha)** ne kaha ke Allah kay Rasool (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ki wafaat tak unka ghar kabhi do siyah cheezon (rotio aur khajoor) se pet bhar kar nahi khaya. (Bukhari aur Muslim)."
"4195","alnaman b۔ bshyr nay kha: kya tmharay pas wh khana awr pyna nhyn hay jw tm chahtay hw؟ myn nay aap kay nby kw dykha hay kh pyt bhrnay kay lyay atny naqs khjwryn nhyn mlty thyn۔ mslm nay asay mntql kya۔"
"4196","abw aywb rzy allh anh khtay hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kay pas khana laya gya tw aap sly allh alyh wslm nay as myn say kchh khaya awr jw bcha hwa asay bhyj dya۔ ayk dn jb as nay asay ayk dsh bhyjy js myn lhsn tha as lyay as nay kchh nhyn khaya tha tw as nay as say pwchha kh kya yh hram hay tw as nay jwab dya kh nhyn، lykn mjhay as ky bdbw ky wjh say napsnd hay۔ tw as nay kha kh myn asay napsnd krta hwn jw tm napsnd krtay hw۔ mslm nay asay mntql kya۔"
"4197","hzrt jabr rzy allh anh say mrwy hay kh nby krym sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya kh jw shkhs lhsn ya pyaz khayay wh hm say dwr rhay۔ ya as nay kha، \hmary msjd say dwr rhna chahyay،\"" ya، \""apnay ghr myn bythna chahyay۔\"" nby sly allh alyh wslm kay pas sbz sbzywn ka ayk brtn laya gya، lykn aap nay dykha kh as myn bdbw aa rhy hay، aap sly allh alyh wslm nay anhyn apnay ayk shaby kw day dw، aap sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”khao، kywnkh myn as say mbashrt krta hwn js say tm nhyn krtay۔ sy ayf mrqat، iv، 373 (bkhary w mslm)"""
"4198","almqdm b۔ madykryb nay nby sly allh alyh wslm say rwayt ky hay kh aap nay frmaya: \agr tm apnay khanay ky pymaysh krw gay* tw tmhyn as myn brkt mlay gy۔\"" *yh khryd w frwkht jysay maamlat ka hwalh dytay hyn awr as bat ka khyal rkhtay hyn kh ksy kay bchwn kw mnasb hsh dya jayay۔ bkhary nay asay nql kya۔"""
"4199","abw amamh rzy allh anh khtay hyn kh jb rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm ka kpra atara gya tw aap nay frmaya: ”khda ky hmd bht zyadh awr khlws kay sath hw، aysy ftrt ky jw brkt pyda krnay waly hw، nakafy، trk shdh ya nzr andaz nhyn hw skty، aay hmaray rb! * lfz maydh ka mtlb hay chmray ka tkra ya kwyy awr chyz jw khanay kay lyay zmyn pr phylayy jaty hay awr as kay many khana hy kay hyn۔ as ka aksr trjmh 'tybl' kya jata hay، lykn yh aslam kay abtdayy dwr kay hwalay say gmrah kn hay۔ bkhary nay asay nql kya۔"
"4200","ans rzy allh anh say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”allh taalyٰ as wqt khwsh hwta hay jb aadmy kchh khata hay awr as ky taryf krta hay، ya kchh pyta hay awr as pr as ky taryf krta hay۔ mslm nay asay mntql kya۔"
"4201","abw aywb rzy allh anh khtay hyn kh hm nby sly allh alyh wslm kay sath thay jb aap sly allh alyh wslm kw khana pysh kya jata tha، myn nay kbhy aysa khana nhyn dykha jw khanay say zyadh brkt wala hw ya jb hm khana khtm kr lyn tw km hw۔ hm nay khda kay rswl say pwchha kh yh kysa hay، tw aap nay jwab dya kh hm nay khana khatay wqt khda ka nam lya، phr js nay khaya wh khda ka nam lyay bghyr byth gya awr shytan as kay sath kha gya۔ yh shrh alsn myn mntql hwty hay۔"
"4202","hzrt aayshh rzy allh anha say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: jb tm myn say kwyy khayay awr apnay khanay pr allh ka zkr krna bhwl jayay tw asay chahyay kh shrwa awr aakhr myn allh ka nam lay۔ asay trmzy awr abwdaod nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"4203","amyh by۔ mkhshy nay btaya kh ayk shkhs jw kha rha tha awr khda ka nam nhyn lya tha، jb as nay aakhry lqmh mnh pr athaya tw kha، ’’shrwa awr aakhr myn khda ka nam lay kr‘‘۔ nby krym sly allh alyh wslm hnsay awr frmaya kh shytan as kay sath khata rha lykn jb as nay allh ka nam lya tw as kay pyt myn jw tha asay qay kr dy۔ abwdaod nay asay nql kya hay۔"
"4204","abw sayd khdry rzy allh anh khtay hyn kh jb rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay khana khaya tw frmaya: allh ka shkr hay js nay hmyn khana pyna dya awr hmyn mslman bnaya۔ asay trmzy، abwdaod awr abn majh nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"4205","abwhryrh rzy allh anh say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”khanay wala awr shkr krnay wala rwzh dar awr sbr krnay walay ky trh hay۔ asay trmzy nay nql kya hay۔"
"4206","abn majh awr darmy nay asay snan b ky snd say rwayt kya hay۔ sna apnay wald kay akhtyar pr۔"
"4207","hzrt abw aywb rzy allh anh khtay hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay jb khaya pya tw frmaya: shkr hay as allh kay lyay js nay khana pyna dya، nglnay kw aasan bnaya awr as kay lyay nklnay ka rasth dya۔ abwdaod nay asay nql kya hay۔"
"4208","slman nay kha kh myn nay twrat myn prha hay kh khanay ky brkt as kay bad wzw krnay myn hay awr jb anhwn nay as ka zkr nby sly allh alyh wslm say kya tw aap nay frmaya: khanay ky brkt as say phlay wzw awr as kay bad wzw hay۔ asay trmzy awr abwdaod nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"4209","abn abas rzy allh anhma say mrwy hay kh jb nby sly allh alyh wslm kay samnay khana pysh kya gya ya aap kay prhyz say bahr aa rhay thay awr aap say pwchha gya kh kya aap aap kay lyay wzw kay lyay pany layyn tw aap sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: mjhay srf nmaz kay lyay wzw krnay ka hkm dya gya hay۔ asay trmzy، abwdaod awr nsayy nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"4210","abn majh nay asay abwhryrh rzy allh anh say rwayt kya hay۔"
"4211","abn abas rzy allh anhma byan krtay hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kay pas ayk tsht laya gya js myn sryd tha، aap nay frmaya: ”as kay atraf say khao، drmyan say nhyn، kywnkh as kay drmyan myn brkt nazl hwty hay۔ *rwty kw tkra kr swp kay sath mlaya jayay js myn gwsht kay tkray hwsktay hyn۔ asay trmzy، abn majh awr darmy nay rwayt kya hay، trmzy khtay hyn kh yh hsn shyh hay۔ abwdaod ky rwayt myn hay kh \jb tm myn say kwyy khayay tw wh brtn kay awpr say nh khayay، blkh nychay say khayay، kywnkh brkt as kay awpr say nazl hwty hay۔\"""""
"4212","abdallh bn amrw nay kha kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kw kbhy khana khatay hwyay tyk lgatay awr dw aadmywn kay sath ayrywn pr chltay hwyay nhyn dykha gya، abwdaod nay asay nql kya hay۔"
"4213","abdallh by۔ alhars b jaz nay kha: rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kay pas kchh rwty awr gwsht laya gya jb wh msjd myn thay، aap nay khaya awr hm nay aap kay sath khaya۔ phr aap sly allh alyh wslm khray hwyay awr nmaz prhy awr hm nay aap sly allh alyh wslm kay sath nmaz prhy، knkrywn say hath saf krnay kay alawh kchh nhyn kya۔ asay abn majh nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"4214","abwhryrh rzy allh anh nay byan kya kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kay pas kchh gwsht laya gya، jb aap sly allh alyh wslm ky pyshany ka ayk hsh jw aap sly allh alyh wslm kw psnd tha، pysh kya gya tw aap sly allh alyh wslm nay asay kat lya۔ asay trmzy awr abn majh nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"4215","hzrt aayshh rzy allh anha say mrwy hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: gwsht kw chhry say mt katw، kywnkh yh ayk ajnby aml hay، blkh asay katw، kywnkh yh zyadh mfyd awr sht bkhsh hay۔ abwdaod awr byhqy nay shab alayman myn asay nql kya hay، dwnwn khtay hyn kh yh qwy nhyn hay۔"
"4216","am almnzr rzy allh anha nay kha: allh kay rswl sly allh alyh wslm myry ayadt kay lyay tshryf layay awr an kay sath aly rzy allh anh kay sath khjwryn pk rhy thyn۔ as nay khana shrwa kya awr aly bhy as kay sath thay، lykn rswl khda nay aly say kha: \rk jao aly، kywnkh tm thyk hw rhay hw\""۔ phr myn nay an kay lyay chqndr awr jw tyar kya tw rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya kh aly as myn say kchh lay lw kywnkh yh tmharay lyay zyadh faydh mnd hw ga۔ asay ahmd، trmzy awr abn majh nay rwayt kya hay۔"""
"4217","ans nay kha kh khda kay rswl kw brtn kay nychay waly chyz psnd aayy۔ as ka mtlb hay 'drygz'، ya 'jw nychay tk dwbta hay'۔ mndrjh bala trjmay myn many kay lyay trjyh dy gyy hay \ya tw as lyay kh dyg kay nchlay hsay myn jw kchh hay wh zyadh dyr pkaya jata hay awr baqy chyzwn say bhtr hay، ya as lyay kh nby sly allh alyh wslm dwsrwn kw sb say phlay pysh kya jana psnd krtay thay۔ yh bhy tjwyz kya gya hay kh yhan sfl ka mtlb sryd hay۔ trmzy awr byhqy nay shab alayman myn asay nql kya hay۔"""
"4218","nwbyshh nay rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kw byan krtay hwyay kha: \agr kwyy brtn myn say kha kr chat lay tw wh brtn as kay lyay astghfar kray ga۔\"" ahmd، trmzy، abn majh awr darmy nay asay rwayt kya hay، trmzy khtay hyn kh yh ghryb rwayt hay۔"""
"4219","abwhryrh rzy allh anh say mrwy hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”jw shkhs apnay hath pr chknayy kay sath rat gzaray jsay as nay dhwya hy nhyn، tw wh srf apnay aap kw mlamt kray ga jb asay kwyy msybt phnchay“۔ asay trmzy، abwdaod awr abn majh nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"4220","abn abas rzy allh anhma nay kha kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kw jw khana sb say zyadh psnd tha wh rwty say bny tryd awr hys say bny hwyy ghza thy۔ [sfhh dykhyn۔ abwdaod nay asay rwayt kya hay۔"
"4221","abw asyd alansary rzy allh anh say mrwy hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”zytwn ka tyl khao awr as say malsh krw، kywnkh yh mbark drkht say nklta hay۔ asay trmzy، abn majh awr darmy nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"4222","am hany rzy allh anha khty hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm myry ayadt kay lyay tshryf layay awr pwchha kh kya myray pas kchh hay؟ jb myn nay jwab dya kh myray pas swkhy rwty awr srkh kay swa kchh nhyn hay tw aap sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”asay pyda krw، js ghr myn srkh hw wh msalhh jat say khaly nhyn hwta۔ trmzy nay asay rwayt kya hay awr kha hay kh yh hsn ghryb rwayt hay۔"
"4223","ywsf by۔ abdallh by۔ slam nay kha kh myn nay nby sly allh alyh wslm kw jw ky rwty ka ayk tkra lay kr as pr khjwr daltay dykha۔ yh khh kr as nay kha lya۔ abwdaod nay asay nql kya hay۔"
"4224","sad rzy allh anh khtay hyn kh jb myn bymar tha tw nby krym sly allh alyh wslm myry ayadt kay lyay tshryf layay awr myray nplwn kay drmyan apna hath rkha takh myn as ky thndk apnay dl pr mhsws krwn، aap sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”tm dl ky bymary myn mbtla hw، hars bn kldh kay pas jao jw sqyf say talq rkhta hay، kywnkh wh dwa krta hay، awr as say mdynh ky sat ajwh khjwryn lay kr an kay sath ml kr an kw ayk aadh pys kr dw۔ abwdaod nay asay nql kya hay۔"
"4225","aayshh rzy allh anha khty hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm tazh khjwr kay sath khrbwzh khatay thay۔ asay trmzy nay nql kya hay۔ abwdaod nay mzyd kha kh wh khtay thay kh ayk ky grmy dwsray ky thndk say twt jaty hay awr ayk ky thndk dwsray ky grmy say۔ trmzy nay kha kh yh hsn ghryb rwayt hay۔"
"4226","ans rzy allh anh nay byan kya kh jb nby sly allh alyh wslm kay pas kchh prany khjwryn layy gyyn tw aap nay an ka jayzh lya awr an myn say kyray nkalay۔ abwdaod nay asay nql kya hay۔"
"4227","abn amr rzy allh anh khtay hyn kh jb nby sly allh alyh wslm kw tbwk myn pnyr ka ayk tkra laya gya tw aap nay chhry mngwayy awr allh ka nam lynay kay bad asay kat dya۔ abwdaod nay asay nql kya hay۔"
"4228","slman nay btaya kh jb khda kay rswl say saf mkhn، pnyr awr jngly gdhay kay baray myn swal kya gya tw anhwn nay jwab dya، \jw chyz hlal hay wh wh hay jsay allh nay apny ktab myn hlal qrar dya hay، jsay allh nay apny ktab myn hram qrar dya hay، awr js chyz kay baray myn as nay kchh nhyn kha wh an chyzwn say talq rkhta hay jn kw wh nzr andaz krta hay۔\"" abn majh awr trmzy nay asay rwayt kya hay، trmzy khtay hyn kh yh ghryb rwayt hay jw kh shyh tryn qwl kay mtabq mwqwf hay۔"""
"4229","abn amr rzy allh anhma say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”kash myray pas ayk sfyd rwty hwty jw gndm say bny hwty awr asay mkhn awr dwdh say nrm kya jata۔ ayk aadmy jw whan mwjwd tha atha awr asay lay aaya۔ as nay pwchha kh as myn kya tha، awr jb asay btaya gya kh yh chhpkly ky khal myn hay tw as nay asay htanay kw kha۔ abwdaod awr abn majh nay asay rwayt kya hay، abwdaod khtay hyn kh yh rwayt rd hay۔"
"4230","aly rzy allh anh khtay hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay lhsn khanay say mna frmaya hay jb tk kh asay pkaya nh jayay۔ asay trmzy awr abwdaod nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"4231","abw zyad nay byan kya kh jb anhwn nay aayshh rzy allh anha say pyaz kay baray myn pwchha tw anhwn nay jwab dya kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay jw aakhry khana khaya tha wh pyaz tha۔ abwdaod nay asay nql kya hay۔"
"4232","bsr kay dw slmy bytwn nay btaya kh jb khda ka rswl an say mlnay aaya tw anhwn nay anhyn mkhn awr khjwr pysh kyn kywnkh wh mkhn awr khjwr kw psnd krtay thay۔ * kha jata hay kh yh abdallh awr atlyh thay۔ lykn hr ayk kw myzyny kha jata hay۔ abn abd albr، astyaab، s:۔ 67، bsr alslmy ka zkr krtay hwyay khtay hyn kh anhyn almzny bhy kha jata hay۔ thzyb، v، 158 myn abdallh almzny alqysy awr vii، 223 myn atyh almzny hlaly kha gya hay۔ abwdaod nay asay nql kya hay۔"
"4233","'akrsh by. zwyb nay kha: hmaray pas ayk thal laya gya js myn bht zyadh tryd awr bghyr hdy walay gwsht kay tkray thay awr myn nay apnay hath kw charwn trf ltkaya، lykn rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay jw kchh an kay samnay tha، kha lya۔ as nay bayyn hath say myra dayan hath pkra awr kha: akrash ayk jgh say khao kywnkh yh sb ayk hy qsm ka khana hay۔ as kay bad hmaray pas ayk plyt layy gyy js myn trh trh ky khjwryn thyn awr myn nay jw kchh myray samnay tha wh khanay lga jb kh khda kay rswl ka hath plyt myn ghwmta rha۔ as nay phr kha، \jhan chahw khao، aqrsh، kywnkh yh sb ayk qsm ka nhyn hay۔\"" hmaray lyay agla pany laya gya awr jb rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay apnay hath dhwyay awr apnay chhray، bazwon awr sr ka msh apnay hathwn ky hthylywn ky rtwbt say kya tw aap nay frmaya: \""yh aqrash as ka wzw hay jw aag say bdl gya hay۔\"" asay trmzy nay nql kya hay۔"""
"4234","aayshh rzy allh anha khty hyn kh jb an kay ghr walay bkhar say thk chkay thay tw rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay kchh hsh tyar krnay ka hkm dya awr phr anhyn as myn say kchh pynay ka hkm dya۔ awr frmaya krtay thay kh yh ghmgyn kw dl krta hay awr batl kay dl kw saf krta hay jysa kh tm myn say kwyy apnay chhray say gndgy kw pany say saf krta hay۔ *ayk qsm ka sabn jw aatay، pany awr tyl ya saf mkhn say bna hwta hay۔ trmzy nay asay rwayt kya hay awr kha hay kh yh hsn shyh hay۔"
"4235","abwhryrh rzy allh anh say mrwy hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”ajwh khjwr jnt say aaty hay awr as myn zhr ka alaj hwta hay، khjwr mn ky ayk qsm hay awr an ka rs aankh kay lyay dwa hay۔ asay trmzy nay nql kya hay۔"
"4236","almghyrh b۔ shabh rzy allh anh nay kha: myn ayk rat rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kay sath mhman tha، aap sly allh alyh wslm nay ayk hwz kw bhwnnay ka hkm dya، phr ayk chwra chhry lay kr myray lyay tkray tkray krnay lgay۔ blal phr asay btanay aayay kh nmaz ka wqt hw gya hay، awr as nay chhry yh khh kr nychay phynk dy، \as kay sath kya maamlh hay، as kay hath khak aalwd hw jayyn!\""* myry mwnchhyn lmby thyn، as lyay as nay kha، \""myn asay aap kay lyay dant ky chhry pr kat dwn ga۔ *trbt yadh۔ myn nay yhan as jmlay ka lfzy trjmh kya hay، lykn cf. s 658۔ asay aam twr pr lfzy twr pr nhyn lya jata۔ as rwayt myn nby sly allh alyh wslm ky narazgy zahr hay kywnkh atny jldy azan dy gyy hay lykn yh nh smjha jayay kh wh blal pr lant bhyj rhay hyn۔ yhan as kay astamal myn yh ksy hd tk narazgy ky nshandhy kr skta hay، lykn as say zyadh kchh nhyn۔ trmzy nay rwayt ky hay*"""
"4237","hzyfh rzy allh anh khtay hyn kh jb hm rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kay sath khana khatay thay tw hm apnay hath myn hath nhyn daltay thay jb tk kh aap sly allh alyh wslm phlay hath nh dal lyn۔ ayk dfah jb hm aap sly allh alyh wslm kay pas khana kha rhay thay tw ayk lrky as trh andr aayy gwya asay mjbwr kya ja rha tha awr khanay myn apna hath dalnay hy waly thy kh khda kay rswl nay as ka hath pkr lya۔ phr ayk khanh bdwsh arb as trh aaya gwya asay mjbwr kya ja rha tha awr as nay as ka hath pkr lya۔ allh kay rswl nay phr frmaya kh shytan khanay kw hlal smjhta hay jb kh as pr khda ka nam nhyn lya jata awr wh as lrky kw as kay zryah say hlal krnay kay lyay lay aaya tw myn nay as ka hath pkra، phr wh as khanh bdwsh arb kw lay aaya takh as kay zryah hlal hw tw myn nay as ka hath pkr lya، as ky qsm js kay hath myn myry jan hay، as kay sath shytan ka hath hay۔ as nay ayk nskhh myn mzyd kha، ’’phr as nay khda ka nam lya awr khaya۔‘‘ mslm nay asay mntql kya۔"
"4238","aayshh rzy allh anha nay byan kya kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm ayk nwjwan ghlam kw khrydna chahtay thay، as lyay aap sly allh alyh wslm nay kchh khjwryn aap kay samnay phynk dyn، lykn jb nwjwan nay lalch say khaya tw aap sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”fzwl khana bra hay“ awr asay waps bhyjnay ka hkm dya۔ byhqy nay asay shab alayman myn nql kya hay۔"
"4239","ans by malk nay khda kay rswl kw yh khtay hwyay rpwrt kya، \aap kay msalhh jat ka malk nmk hay۔\"" * * shayd as ka mtlb yh hay kh nmk khanay kw lzyz bnanay kay lyay zrwry hay، jbkh dygr msalhh jat azafy hyn۔ asay abn majh nay rwayt kya hay۔"""
"4240","as nay khda kay rswl kw yh khtay hwyay byan kya kh \jb khana rkha jayay tw apnay jwtay atar dw، kywnkh as say tmharay pyrwn kw zyadh aaram mlta hay۔\"""""
"4241","asmaa bnt abwbkr rzy allh anh nay byan kya kh jb anhyn srya laya gya tw anhwn nay hkm dya kh asay dhanp dya jayay yhan tk kh as ky bhap khtm hw jayay awr kha kh anhwn nay rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kw yh frmatay hwyay sna hay kh yh brkt pyda krnay myn zyadh mosr hay۔ darmy nay dwnwn rwaytyn nql ky hyn۔"
"4242","nwbyshh nay byan kya kh khda kay rswl nay frmaya: \agr kwyy dsh myn say khata hay awr asay chatta hay، tw wh brtn as kay samnay yh khwahsh zahr kray ga kh khda asay jhnm say as trh aazad kray jysa kh as nay shytan say aazad kya hay۔\"" razn nay asay mntql kya۔"""
"4243","abwhryrh rzy allh anh say mrwy hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”jw shkhs allh awr ywm aakhrt pr ayman rkhta hay asay chahyay kh wh apnay mhman ky azt kray، jw allh awr ywm aakhrt pr ayman rkhta hay wh apnay prwsy kw tng nh kray، awr jw allh awr ywm aakhrt pr ayman rkhta hw asay chahyay kh wh achhy bat khay ya khamwsh rhay۔ ayk wrzhn myn prwsy kay baray myn bat krnay kay bjayay aap nay frmaya، \jw khda awr aakhrt kay dn pr yqyn rkhta hay asay rshth jwrna chahyay۔\"" (bkhary w mslm)"""
"4244","hzrt abwshryh alkaby rzy allh anh say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”jw shkhs allh awr ywm aakhrt pr ayman rkhta hay asay chahyay kh wh apnay mhman ky azt kray، rastay ka saman wh hay jw dn rat khdmt kray، mhman nwazy tyn dn tk hw، as say brh kr sdqh hay، awr yh jayz nhyn kh mhman as wqt tk thhray jb tk kh wh apnay aap kw mslman nh bna lay“۔"
"4245","aqbh b۔ aamr nay byan kya kh anhwn nay rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm say kha kh aap hmyn bahr bhyj dytay hyn awr hm aysay lwgwn kay pas aatay hyn jw hmary mhman nwazy nhyn krtay tw aap ky kya rayay hay؟ aap sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”agr tm aysay lwgwn kay pas aao jw tmharay lyay mhman kay lyay mnasb chyz ka hkm dytay hyn tw asay qbwl krw awr agr wh nh manyn tw an say wh lay lw jw an kay lyay mhman kw dynay kay lyay mwzwn hw۔ (bkhary w mslm)"
"4246","abwhryrh rzy allh anh nay byan kya kh jb rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm ayk dn ya rat kw bahr nklay tw abwbkr awr amr rzy allh anhma say mlay awr an say pwchha kh as wqt anhyn an kay ghrwn say ks chyz nay nkala؟ jb anhwn nay jwab dya kh bhwk hay tw aap sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya myray sath bhy aysa hy hay، as ky qsm js kay hath myn myry jan hay، js chyz nay tmhyn nkala as nay mjhay nkala، athw۔ wh athay awr an kay sath ansar kay ayk aadmy kay pas gyay lykn wh ghr pr nhyn tha۔ as ky bywy nay jb asay dykha tw as nay dl say khwsh aamdyd kha awr khda kay rswl nay as say pwchha kh flan khan gya hay tw as nay jwab dya kh myn an kay lyay mytha pany lynay gya tha۔ asy wqt ansary nmwdar hwyay awr rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm awr an kay dw sathywn kw dykh kr frmaya: alhmd llh aaj mjh say zyadh mazz mhman ksy kay pas nhyn hay۔ phr wh gya awr an kay lyay ayk gchha laya js myn pknay waly khjwryn، swkhy khjwryn awr tazh khjwryn thyn awr an say kha kh as myn say kchh khao as nay apny chhry lay ly۔ khda kay rswl nay asay tnbyh ky kh wh dwdh dynay walay janwr kw nh marw، as nay an kay lyay ayk bhyr zbh ky۔ awr jb anhwn nay as myn say khaya awr py lya tw rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay abwbkr w amr rzy allh anhma say frmaya kh as zat ky qsm js kay hath myn myry jan hay، qyamt kay dn tm say as fzl kay baray myn swal kya jayay ga، bhwk nay tmhyn tmharay ghrwn say nkala، phr tm as wqt tk waps nh aayay jb tk yh fzl tmharay pas nh aaya۔ 1. yh qabl zkr hay kh as awr as kay bad kay jmlay myn dwsra shkhs zmyr jma hay halankh dw afrad kw mkhatb kya gya hay۔ mslm nay asay mntql kya۔ abw msawd rzy allh anh ky rwayt \ansar myn say ayk...\"" ka zkr shady byah kay bab myn aaya hay۔ 2 2. dykhyn sfhh۔ 684."""
"4247","almqdm b۔ mdkryb nay rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kw frmatay hwyay sna kh agr kwyy mslman lwgwn ka mhman hw awr asay kchh nh dya jayay tw hr mslman pr as ky mdd krna frz hay kh wh an kay mal myn say as kay lyay as hd tk mdd kray awr jtny tfryh as kw mlny chahyay thy wh as kay lyay tyar kray۔ asay darmy awr abwdaod nay rwayt kya hay۔ mokhr alzkr ka ayk nskhh yh hay kh \agr kwyy aysay lwgwn ka mhman hay jw as ky mhman nwazy nhyn krtay hyn tw wh an say mhman nwazy kay brabr lynay ka hqdar hay۔\"""""
"4248","abwalahwas aljshmy nay apnay wald say nql kya hay kh anhwn nay kha kh aay khda kay rswl، mjhay btayyay kh agr myn ksy aysay shkhs kay pas aaon jw mjhay kwyy mhman nwazy ya mhman nwazy nhyn krta awr wh as kay bad myray pas aata hay tw kya myn asay tfryh dwn ya as kay sath aysa slwk krwn jysa kh as nay myray sath kya؟ as nay jwab dya kh nhyn، asay tfryh dw۔ asay trmzy nay nql kya hay۔"
"4249","ans ya ksy awr nay byan kya kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay sad rzy allh anh kay ghr myn dakhl hwnay ky ajazt chahy۔ abadh nay kha kh tm pr slamty hw awr khda ky rhmt hw، awr sad nay jwab dya، \awr tm pr slamty awr khda ky rhmt hw\"" lykn atny blnd aawaz myn nhyn bwlay kh nby sly allh alyh wslm sn sktay۔ aap sly allh alyh wslm nay tyn bar slam kya awr sad rzy allh anh nay tyn bar jwab dya، lykn atny awnchy aawaz myn nh bwlay kh wh sn skyn، chnanchh aap sly allh alyh wslm chlay gyay۔ sad as kay pychhay gya awr khnay lga: aay khda kay rswl، js kay lyay myn apnay wald awr waldh kw fdyh kay twr pr dwn ga، aap nay myry bat snay awr aap kw jwab dynay kay bghyr slam nhyn kya، lykn myn nay atny blnd aawaz say bat nhyn ky kh aap sn skyn kywnkh myn aap kay bht say drwd w slam kw qbwl krna chahta hwn awr as trh bry brktyn hasl krna chahta hwn۔ phr wh ghr myn dakhl hwyay awr as nay asay kshmsh pysh ky jsay khda kay nby nay khaya۔ phr jb fargh hwyay tw frmaya kh nyk lwg tmhara khana khayyn، frshtay tm pr drwd bhyjyn awr jw rwzh dar hyn wh tmharay sath aftar kryn! yh shrh alsn myn mntql hwty hay۔"""
"4250","abwsayd rzy allh anh say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”mwmn awr ayman ayk ghwray ky mannd hyn js say asay bandha jata hay، jw ghwmta hay awr phr apny dagh pr lwt aata hay، kywnkh mwmn ghafl hwta hay awr phr ayman ky trf lwtta hay، mtqywn kw apna khana khlao awr mwmnwn pr ahsan krw۔ byhqy nay shab alayman myn awr abw naym nay hlyh myn asay nql kya hay۔"
"4251","abdallh by bsr nay byan kya kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kay pas alghraa 1 nam ka ayk tsht tha jsay char aadmy athayay hwyay thay awr jb anhwn nay zhr ky nmaz prhy tw wh brtn laya gya js myn sryd tyar ky gyy thy awr lwg as kay grd jma hw gyay۔ jb wh bay shmar thay tw khda kay rswl nay ghtnay tyk dyay awr jb ayk khanh bdwsh arb nay pwchha kh yh kysa bythna hay tw khda kay rswl nay jwab dya kh khda nay mjhay ayk mhrban bndh bnaya hay nh kh zalm zalm۔ phr frmaya kh agr tm as kay atraf say khao awr awpr kw chhwr dw tw as pr brkt hw gy۔ 1. mtlb sfyd wala۔ abwdaod nay asay nql kya hay۔"
"4252","whshy by۔ harb nay apnay wald kay hkm pr kha kh an kay dada nay khda kay rswl kay shabh kay baray myn kha kh \khda kay rswl hm khatay hyn lykn syr nhyn hwtay۔\"" as nay mshwrh dya kh wh alg alg khana khayyn، awr jb anhwn nay jwab dya kh aysa hy hay tw as nay kha، \""agr tm apnay khanay pr akthay hw kr khda ka nam lw gay tw tmhyn as myn brkt mlay gy۔\"" abwdaod nay asay nql kya hay۔"""
"4253","abwaasb rzy allh anh khtay hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm rat kw bahr nklay awr jb myray pas say gzray awr mjhay blaya tw myn aap kay pas gya۔ as kay bad wh abwbkr kay pas say gzray، jb anhwn nay anhyn blaya tw wh an kay pas chlay gyay۔ phr wh amr rzy allh anh kay pas say gzray awr jb anhwn nay anhyn blaya tw wh an kay pas chlay gyay۔ phr wh rwanh hwa awr jb ansar myn say ayk bagh myn dakhl hwa tw as nay bagh kay malk say kha kh hmyn kchh pknay waly khjwryn khanay kay lyay dyn۔ aap sly allh alyh wslm nay ayk gtha la kr rkh dya، jb aap sly allh alyh wslm awr aap kay sathywn nay khana kha lya tw aap sly allh alyh wslm nay thnda pany mngwaya، jsay pynay kay bad aap sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”qyamt kay dn tm say as fzl kay baray myn swal kya jayay ga۔ as kay bad amr rzy allh anh nay as gchhay kw pkr lya awr jb asay zmyn pr phynk dya kh pknay waly khjwryn rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm ky trf bkhr gyyn tw anhwn nay arz kya ya rswl allh kya qyamt kay dn hm say as kay baray myn pwchha jayay ga؟ as nay jwab dya: han، lykn tyn chyzwn kay lyay nhyn: ayk chythra js say aadmy apny shrmgah kw dhanpta hay، ya ayk tkra js say wh apny bhwk mtata hay، ya ayk pnah gah js myn wh grmy awr srdy say bchnay kay lyay apnay aap kw grm krta hay۔ 1. lfz hjr hay jw bnyady twr pr hram chyz hay as kay bad asay mty ya pthr say dhanpnay waly jgh kay twr pr astamal kya jata hay۔ mndrjh zyl alfaz as bat ky nshandhy krtay hyn kh bht chhwty chyz ka aradh kya gya hay۔ sy ayf mrqat، iv، 397. Pt. 12 ahmd awr byhqy nay shab alayman myn asay nql kya hay۔"
"4254","abn amr rzy allh anhma say mrwy hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”jb kpra nychay kr dya jayay tw aadmy as wqt tk nh athay jb tk kh asay nh atar dya jayay، awr nh hy hath htana chahyay agrchh as kay pas kafy hw yhan tk kh lwg fargh hw jayyn، lykn agr aysa hw tw asay azr pysh krna chahyay، kywnkh as say as kay sathy kw shrm aaty hay awr wh apna hath nhyn brhata، agrchh asay khanay ky zrwrt hw۔ abn majh awr byhqy nay shab alayman myn asay nql kya hay۔"
"4255","jafr by۔ mhmd nay apnay wald kay akhtyar pr btaya kh jb khda kay rswl nay lwgwn kay sath khana khaya tw wh khana khtm krnay walay aakhry shkhs thay۔ byhqy nay asay shab alayman myn mrsl ky swrt myn nql kya hay۔"
"4256","yzyd ky byty asmaa rzy allh anha khty hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kay lyay kchh khana laya gya jw aap sly allh alyh wslm nay hmyn pysh kya، jb hm nay kha kh hmyn yh nhyn chahyay tw aap sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: jhwt kw bhwk kay sath nh mlaw۔ asay abn majh nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"4257","amr by۔ alkhtab nay rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kw yh khtay hwyay rwayt kya hay kh \akthay khao alg alg nhyn، kywnkh brkt kmpny say wabsth hay۔\"" asay abn majh nay rwayt kya hay۔"""
"4258","hzrt abwhryrh rzy allh anh say mrwy hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: yh snt ka hsh hay kh aadmy apnay mhman kay sath ghr kay drwazay pr aayay۔ asay abn majh nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"4259","byhqy nay shab alayman myn asay abwhryrh awr abn abas dwnwn ky snd say rwayt kya hay lykn kha kh as ky snd myn zaf hay۔"
"4260","abn abas rzy allh anhma say mrwy hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”js ghr myn khana dya jata hay as myn khyr as say zyadh jldy aaty hay jtna awnt kay kwhan myn chhry aaty hay۔ 1 1. yh rwayt mhman nwaz ghr ky bat krty hay، awnt kay kwhan ka zkr as lyay kya gya hay kh yh as janwr ka phla hsh hay js say gwsht kata jata hay، kywnkh yh as kay gwsht ka sb say khwshgwar hsh smjha jata hay۔ asay abn majh nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"4261","alfjayy alamyry nay byan kya kh wh nby krym sly allh alyh wslm kay pas aayay awr pwchha kh wh kwn say janwr jw qdrty mwt say mr gyay hwn anhyn khaya ja skta hay؟ as nay pwchha kh anhwn nay kya khaya hay، awr jwab mlnay pr nghtbk wnstbyh، js ka mtlb abw naym say aqbh nay byan kya hay kh anhwn nay ayk pyalh sbh awr ayk pyalh sham kw pya tha، tw aap nay frmaya: \myray wald ky qsm، yh bhwk hay\"" awr aysy haltwn myn anhyn khanay ky ajazt dy jw qdrty mwt waqa hwyy thy۔ abwdaod nay asay nql kya hay۔"""
"4262","abw waqd allysy byan krtay hyn kh ayk aadmy nay arz kya kh ya rswl allh hm ayk aysy srzmyn myn rhtay hyn jhan hmyn bhwk lgy hay tw hm aysay janwrwn kw kb kha sktay hyn jw qdrty mwt mr gyay hwn؟ as nay jwab dya، \jb tk tm sbh ka mshrwb ya sham ka mshrwb nh pyw ya sbzyan jma nh kr lw، tm anhyn kha sktay hw\"" yany jb sbh ka mshrwb ya sham ka mshrwb nh mlay ya khanay kay lyay kwyy sbzy nh mlay، tw wh janwr jw qdrty mwt say mr chkay hwn، tmharay lyay jayz hyn۔ darymy nay asay mntql kya۔"""
"4263","ans rzy allh anh khtay hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm pytay wqt tyn bar sans lytay thay۔ (bkhary w mslm۔) ayk nskhh myn mslm nay mzyd kha kh wh khtay thay kh yh zyadh pyas bjhanay waly، sht bkhsh awr zyadh sht bkhsh hay۔"
"4264","abn abas rzy allh anh khtay hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay chmray kay mnh say pany pynay say mna frmaya۔ (bkhary w mslm)"
"4265","abw sayd alkhdry khtay hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay pany ky khalwn kay aqtbas say mna frmaya hay، awr ayk nskhh myn mzyd kha hay kh as ka mtlb hay kh an kay sr kw alta kr dya jayay awr phr as say nshh kya jayay۔ (bkhary w mslm)"
"4266","ans rzy allh anh khtay hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay aadmy kw khray hw kr pynay say mna frmaya۔ mslm nay asay mntql kya۔"
"4267","abwhryrh rzy allh anh say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: tm myn say kwyy khray hw kr nh pyay، awr agr kwyy bhwl jayay tw asay qay krna chahyay۔ mslm nay asay mntql kya۔"
"4268","abn abas rzy allh anhma byan krtay hyn kh jb wh nby akrm sly allh alyh wslm kay pas zmzm ka pany lay kr aayay tw aap nay khray hw kr pya۔ (bkhary w mslm)"
"4269","aly nay zhr ky nmaz prhy، phr kwfh kay khlay chwk myn lwgwn ky zrwrtwn kay lyay ayk ajlas mnaqd kya yhan tk kh nmaz asr ka wqt aagya۔ as kay bad asay pany laya gya، kchh pya، apna chhrh awr hath dhwyay، transmytr myn as kay sr awr paon ka zkr bhy tha، phr khray hw kr jw bcha tha asay py lya۔ phr frmaya kh kchh lwg khray hw kr pynay kw napsnd krtay hyn lykn nby sly allh alyh wslm nay why kya jysa myn nay kya hay۔ bkhary nay asay nql kya۔"
"4270","jabr rzy allh anh khtay hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm ansar kay ayk aadmy ky ayadt kay lyay apnay ayk sathy kay sath tshryf lay gyay۔ as nay slam kya tw as aadmy nay jw apnay bagh kw pany pla rha tha، jwab dya۔ aap sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”agr tmharay pas kwyy pany hw jw ksy prany khal myn rat bhr rh gya hw tw hmyn asay psnd krna chahyay، wrnh hm ndy myn say kchh ghwnt lyn gay۔ as nay asay btaya kh as kay pas pany hay jw rat bhr prany khalwn myn pra tha، phr tryls myn gya awr ayk brtn myn pany dala js myn as nay kchh dwdh dala jw as nay ayk ghrylw bkry say nkala، awr nbyﷺ nay pya۔ as nay yh bat dhrayy awr as shkhs nay jw as kay sath tha py lya۔ bkhary nay asay nql kya۔"
"4271","am slmh rzy allh anha say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”jw chandy kay brtnwn myn say pyay ga as kay pyt myn jhnm ky aag bhrk athay gy۔ (bkhary w mslm۔) mslm ka ayk nskhh hay، ’’jw chandy awr swnay kay brtnwn myn say khata pyta hay‘‘۔"
"4272","hzyfh rzy allh anh nay byan kya kh myn nay rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kw yh frmatay hwyay sna: ”ryshm nh phnw، nh swnay awr chandy kay brtnwn say pyw، awr swnay awr chandy kay brtnwn myn say nh khao، kywnkh yh dnya myn dwsrwn kay pas hyn، lykn aakhrt myn tmharay pas hwn gay۔ (bkhary w mslm)"
"4273","ans rzy allh anh nay byan kya kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kay lyay ayk ghrylw bkry ka dwdh playa gya awr as ka dwdh ans rzy allh anh kay ghr kay knwyn kay pany myn mlaya gya۔ as kay bad khda kay rswl kw ayk pyalh dya gya awr pya gya، abwbkr an kay bayyn trf awr ayk khanh bdwsh arb an kay dayyn trf tha۔ amr rzy allh anh nay rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm say kha kh wh abwbkr kw day dyn، lykn aap nay asay as khanh bdwsh arb kw day dya jw an kay dahnay pr tha awr yh khtay hwyay kh \wh jw dayyn trf hay، phr wh jw as kay dayyn trf hay۔\"" ayk nskhh myn hay، \""wh jw dayyn trf hyn، phr wh apnay dayyn trf؛ dayyn trf jao۔ as kay fwraً bad aanay waly rwayt as bat kw wazh krty hay۔ (bkhary w mslm)"""
"4274","shl by۔ sad rzy allh anh nay byan kya kh nby sly allh alyh wslm kay pas ayk pyalh laya gya js myn say aap nay pya، aap kay dayyn trf ayk nwjwan tha jw sb say km amr tha، awr aap kay bayyn trf bwrhay thay۔ as nay nwjwanwn say kha kh wh asay bwrhwn kw dynay ky ajazt dyn، lykn as nay jwab dya، \khda kay rswl، myn aap ky trf say ksy kw trjyh dynay wala nhyn hwn۔\"" tw as nay asay day dya۔ (bkhary w mslm)"""
"4275","abn amr rzy allh anh khtay hyn kh hm rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kay zmanay myn chltay phrtay khatay awr khray hw kr pytay thay۔ asay trmzy، abn majh awr darmy nay rwayt kya hay، trmzy khtay hyn kh yh hsn shyh ghryb rwayt hay۔"
"4276","amrw by۔ shayb nay apnay wald ky trf say kha kh an kay dada nay btaya kh anhwn nay rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kw khray awr bythay dwnwn pytay dykha۔ asay trmzy nay nql kya hay۔"
"4277","abn abas rzy allh anh khtay hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay brtn myn sans lynay ya phwnknay say mna frmaya۔ abwdaod awr abn majh nay asay rwayt kya hay۔"
"4278","as nay khda kay rswl ka yh frman nql kya: \awnt ky trh rkay bghyr nh pyw، blkh apnay mshrwb kw dw ya tyn hswn myn tqsym krw، jb tm pyw tw khda ka nam lw awr jb tm khtm krw tw as ky taryf krw۔\"" *yh brtn myn phwnknay say bchnay kay lyay hay۔ asay trmzy nay nql kya hay۔"""
"4279","abw sayd khdry rzy allh anh khtay hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay mshrwb myn phwnk marnay say mna frmaya۔ jb ayk aadmy nay kha kh as nay brtn myn dhbay dykhay hyn tw as nay asay andylnay kw kha awr jb as nay kha kh as ky pyas ayk sans myn nhyn bjhty hay tw as nay asay kha kh pyalh mnh say hta kr sans lay۔ asay trmzy awr darmy nay nql kya hay۔"
"4280","as nay btaya kh khda kay rswl nay pyalay myn twty hwyy jgh say pynay awr mshrwb myn phwnknay say mna frmaya hay۔ abwdaod nay asay nql kya hay۔"
"4281","kbshh nay kha: allh ka rswl myry ayadt kay lyay tshryf layay awr ltky hwyy chmry kay mnh say khray hw kr pya، myn nay ja kr as ka mnh kat dya۔ [yh tjwyz kya jata hay kh as nay yh kam ya tw as lyay kya tha kh jld kay mnh kw rswl allhﷺ kay aasar kay twr pr rkha jayay ya ksy awr kay lyay asy jgh say pyna nammkn hw jayay۔] trmzy awr abn majh nay asay rwayt kya hay، trmzy khtay hyn kh yh hsn ghryb shyh rwayt hay۔"
"4282","zhry nay arwh ky snd say byan kya kh aayshh nay kha kh rswl allh kw jw mshrwb sb say zyadh psnd tha wh thnda mytha pany tha۔ trmzy nay asay nql krtay hwyay kha kh swty nskhh why hay jw zhry nay rswl allh say mrsl ky swrt myn nql kya hay۔"
"4283","abn abas rzy allh anhma say mrwy hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”jb tm myn say kwyy khana khayay tw asay yh khna chahyay kh aay allh hmyn as myn brkt day awr hmyn as say achhy ghza day، awr jb asay dwdh playa jayay tw wh khay: aay allh hmyn as myn brkt ata frma awr hmyn as say njat ata frma، kywnkh kwyy khana ya pyna dwdh ky trh syr nhyn hwta۔ asay trmzy awr abwdaod nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"4284","aayshh rzy allh anha nay kha kh sqyh kay pany kw nby sly allh alyh wslm nay sb say zyadh mytha smjha۔ kha jata hay kh yh mdynh say dw dn ka knwan tha۔ abwdaod nay asay nql kya hay۔"
"4285","abn amr rzy allh anhma say mrwy hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”js nay swnay ya chandy kay brtn ya as qsm ky kwyy chyz py ly tw as kay pyt myn jhnm ky aag bhrk athay gy۔ darqtny nay asay mntql kya۔"
"4286","ans rzy allh anh nay kha: myn nay apnay as pyalay myn allh kay rswl kw hr qsm ka mshrwb dya hay: shhd، nbyz، pany awr dwdh۔ mslm nay asay mntql kya۔"
"4287","aayshh rzy allh anha khty hyn: hm rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kay lyay khjwryn ayk chmray myn dala krtay thay js kay awpr mnh bndha hwa tha۔ jw kchh hm sbh kw dbwtay wh sham kw pyta awr jw sham kw hm dbwtay wh sbh pyta۔ mslm nay asay mntql kya۔"
"4288","abn abas rzy allh anhma nay byan kya kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kay lyay rat kay shrwa myn khjwryn chrhayy jaty thyn awr aap asay sbh w sham، aglay dn awr rat kay bad awr aglay dn dwphr tk pytay thay۔ agr kchh rh gya tw as nay nwkr kw pynay kay lyay dya ya hkm dya awr bha dya gya۔ mslm nay asay mntql kya۔"
"4289","jabr rzy allh anh khtay hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kay lyay khjwryn ayk chmray myn daly gyy thyn، lykn jb anhyn khal nh mly tw wh pthr kay ayk chhwtay say brtn myn dal dy gyyn۔ mslm nay asay mntql kya۔"
"4290","abn amr rzy allh anh khtay hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay kdw kay astamal say mna frmaya۔ as nay kntynrz kay twr pr an kay astamal say mna kr dya۔] sbz brtn، grhay awr khwkhlay stmp say aalwdh brtn، yh hkm dytay hwyay kh khjwryn khalwn myn daly jayyn۔ mslm nay asay mntql kya۔"
"4291","brydh nay byan kya kh khda kay rswl nay frmaya: \myn nay tm pr khanay kw hram kr dya hay، kywnkh ayk brtn ksy chyz kw hlal ya hram nhyn bnata، hr nshh aawr chyz hram hay۔\"" ayk nskhh myn frmaya kh ’’myn nay tm pr mshrwb hram kya hay swayay chmray kay brtnwn kay، lykn ab tm ksy bhy brtn say pyw lykn nshh waly chyz nh pyw۔‘‘ mslm nay asay mntql kya۔"""
"4292","abw malk ashary rzy allh anh nay rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kw yh frmatay hwyay sna kh myry amt myn say kchh lwg shrab kw dwsray nam say pkaryn gay۔ abwdaod awr abn majh nay asay rwayt kya hay۔"
"4293","abdallh by۔ abw awfy khtay hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay sbz brtnwn myn nbyz say mna frmaya، jb myn nay pwchha kh kya hm asay sfyd say py sktay hyn tw aap sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya kh aysa nhyn hw skta۔ bkhary nay asay nql kya۔"
"4294","jabr rzy allh anh say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”jb rat ky taryky hw jayay ya sham hw jayay tw apnay bchwn kw aktha kr lya krw، kywnkh as wqt shytan bahr hwta hay، awr jb rat ka ayk ghnth gzr jayay tw allh kay nam ka zkr krtay hwyay an kw aazad kr dw awr drwazay bnd kr dw، kywnkh shytan drwazh nhyn khwlta، baltyan bandh kr rkhw، allh ka nam lay kr bhy allh ka zkr krw، allh kay nam ka zkr bhy krw۔ bs an pr kchh rkhw، awr apnay chragh bjha dw۔\ bkhary w mslm۔"""
"4295","bkhary kay ayk nskhay myn aap nay frmaya kh brtn dhanp lw، pany ky khalyn bandhw، drwazay bnd krw awr sham kw apnay bchwn kw jma krw، kywnkh jn byrwn mlk hwtay hyn awr anhyn pkr lytay hyn، awr jb tm swtay hw tw chragh bjha dw، kywnkh chwha aksr bty ghsytta hay awr ghr kw jla dyta hay۔"
"4296","mslm ky ayk rwayt myn aap nay frmaya kh brtn dhanp dw، pany ky khal bandhw، drwazay bnd krw awr chragh bjha dw، kywnkh shytan nh tw pany ky khal khwlta hay، nh drwazh khwlta hay awr nh brtn kw khwlta hay، agr kwyy shkhs srf yh kr skta hay kh apnay brtn pr lkry ka tkra rkh day awr as kay ghr myn khda ka nam lay tw as kay ghr myn aag lga day۔"
"4297","as kay ayk nskhay myn as nay kha: \swrj kay ghrwb hwnay kay wqt apnay janwrwn awr bchwn kw rat kay phlay awr taryk tryn hsay tk nh janay dw، kywnkh shytan kw bahr bhyj dya jata hay؛ swrj ghrwb hwnay say lay kr rat ka phla awr taryk hsh gzr janay tk۔\"""""
"4298","as kay ayk nskhay myn aap nay frmaya: \brtn kw dhanp dw awr pany ky khal kw bandh dw، kywnkh sal myn ayk rat aysy hwty hay jb wba atrty hay، awr wh ksy khlay brtn ya khly hwyy khal say nhyn gzrty jb tk kh as myn say kwyy wba nh atray\""۔"""
"4299","anhwn nay byan kya kh jb ansar myn say abwhmyd nby krym sly allh alyh wslm kay pas nqy say dwdh ka ayk brtn lay kr aayay tw aap sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya kh tm nay as pr lkry ka tkra rkh kr bhy asay kywn nhyn dhanp lya؟ *wady alaqyq myn ayk jgh jhan awnt jw sdqh kyay jatay thay rkhay jatay thay۔ (bkhary w mslm)"
"4300","abn amr rzy allh anhma say mrwy hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”swtay wqt apnay ghrwn myn aag nh chhwrw“۔ (bkhary w mslm)"
"4301","abw mwsyٰ khtay hyn kh jb rat kw mdynh myn ayk ghr as kay mkynwn pr jl gya awr rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kw btaya gya tw aap sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”yh aag tmhary dshmn hay، as lyay jb tm sw jao tw asay bjha dyna۔ (bkhary w mslm)"
"4302","jabr rzy allh anh nay rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kw yh khtay hwyay sna kh jb tm rat kw ktwn kay bhwnknay awr gdhwn kay chykhnay ky aawaz sntay hw tw shytan mrdwd say allh ky pnah mangw، kywnkh wh wh dykhtay hyn jw tm nhyn dykhtay، jb lwg thwray hwn tw zyadh nh nklw، allh kay lyay jw azym awr shan wala hay apny mkhlwqat ka zkr krta hay، rat kay wqt allh kay nam ka zkr krta hay۔ shytan wh drwazh nhyn khwlta jw khda kay nam kay sath bnd kya gya hw، brtnwn kw alt dyn awr baltyan bandh dyn۔\ yh shrh alsn myn mntql hwty hay۔"""
"4303","abn abas rzy allh anhma nay byan kya kh jb ayk chwha ayk bty ghsytta hwa aaya awr asay rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kay samnay chtayy pr gra dya js pr aap bythay hwyay thay as kay ntyjay myn as myn drhm kay brabr swrakh hw gya، aap sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”jb tm sw jao tw apnay chragh bjhao، kywnkh shytan as mkhlwq ky rhnmayy krta hay js trh tmhyn aag lgata hay“۔ abwdaod nay asay nql kya hay۔"
"4304","ans rzy allh anh nay kha kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kw sb say zyadh psnd ka lbas dhary dar chadr tha۔ (bkhary w mslm)"
"4305","almghyrh b۔ shabh nay kha kh nby sly allh alyh wslm nay bazntyny chadr tng aastynwn kay sath phny thy۔ (bkhary w mslm)"
"4306","abw brdh khtay hyn kh aayshh rzy allh anha nay an kay lyay thwray hwyay kpray awr ayk mwtay nchlay kpray kw bahr nkala awr btaya kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm ky rwh as wqt qbz ky gyy jb aap sly allh alyh wslm anhyn phn rhay thay۔ (bkhary w mslm)"
"4307","aayshh rzy allh anha nay kha kh js bstr pr rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm swtay thay wh chmray ka tha js myn khjwr kay ryshay bhray hwyay thay۔ (bkhary w mslm)"
"4308","as nay kha kh wh tkyh js pr khda kay rswl tyk lgayay hwyay thay wh chmray ka tha js myn khjwr kay ryshay bhray hwyay thay۔ mslm nay asay mntql kya۔"
"4309","as nay btaya kh jb wh dwphr ky grmy myn apnay ghr myn bythay hwyay thay tw ksy nay abwbkr say kha، \yh allh ka rswl an kay sr pr sayh kyay hwyay hyn۔\"" bkhary nay asay nql kya۔"""
"4310","jabr rzy allh anh khtay hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay an say frmaya: ”mrd kay lyay bstr، as ky bywy kay lyay awr tysra mhman kay lyay hwna chahyay، lykn chwtha hsh shytan kay lyay hay۔‘‘ (as ky wzaht ky gyy hay kh zrwrt say zyadh hwna dnyawy chyzwn ka shwq، ya kchh dkhaway ky khwahsh zahr krta hay۔ as trh kay aamal qablِ mlamt hyn، awr yh shytan kay sath qablِ mlamt hay)۔ mslm nay asay mntql kya۔"
"4311","abwhryrh rzy allh anh say mrwy hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”qyamt kay dn allh taalyٰ as ky trf nhyn dykhay ga jw apny chadr kw tkbr say pychhay kray ga۔ (bkhary w mslm)"
"4312","abn amr rzy allh anhma say mrwy hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”jw shkhs tkbr say apnay kpray kw pychhay kray ga، allh taalyٰ qyamt kay dn as ky trf nhyn dykhay ga۔“ (bkhary w mslm)"
"4313","as nay khda kay rswl kw yh khtay hwyay byan kya: \jb ayk aadmy apnay nchlay kpray kw pychhay chhwr rha tha tw asay zmyn nay ngl lya، awr asay qyamt kay dn tk asy myn phynk dya jayay ga۔\"" bkhary nay asay nql kya۔"""
"4314","hzrt abwhryrh rzy allh anh say mrwy hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”kpray ka jw hsh tkhnwn say nychay jata hay wh jhnm myn hay۔ bkhary nay asay nql kya۔"
"4315","jabr rzy allh anh khtay hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay mna frmaya kh aadmy apnay bayyn hath say khayay، ya ayk jwty kay sath chlay، ya mkml twr pr kpray myn lpytay، ya ayk hy kpray myn ghtnwn kay grd hath rkh kr byth jayay awr apny shrmgah kw khwlay۔ mslm nay asay mntql kya۔"
